    "hero": {
      "type": "landing-hero",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Made for GLP-1 Users",
        "heading": "Your GLP-1 works hard. So does Tiiga.",
        "text": "<p>The 2-in-1 gut health and hydration drink built to tackle the 4 most common struggles on your GLP-1 journey, naturally.</p>",
        "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Tiiga.Marketing-HP004.jpg",
        "image_2": "",
        "primary_button_label": "Shop Tiiga",
        "primary_button_link": "shopify://products/organic-baobab-coconut-water-prebiotic-electrolyte-supplement-16-pack-bag",
        "secondary_button_label": "See How It Helps",
        "secondary_button_link": "",
        "rating": "4.7",
        "review_count": "850+ reviews",
        "shipping_note": "1M+ members",
        "disclaimer": "<p>Cancel anytime · 30-day money-back guarantee · These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA.</p>",
        "background_color": "#1d5a6b",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "padding-block-start": 64,
        "padding-block-end": 64,
        "layout": "split"
      }
    },
    "story_rows": {
      "type": "story-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "01",
            "eyebrow": "HYDRATION",
            "title": "Dehydration and Dry Mouth",
            "text": "<p>GLP-1 medications accelerate fluid loss and suppress your thirst cues, so most users end up chronically under-hydrated without realizing it. Tiiga is built on coconut water powder, a natural source of potassium, magnesium, and sodium, so every sip replenishes what you're losing. Real hydration, not just water.</p>",
            "media_style": "image_pair",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/tiiga-hydration-chart-v2.png",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/tiiga-replace-chart-v2.png",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "full_width_media": true
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "02",
            "eyebrow": "DIGESTION",
            "title": "Constipation and Slow Digestion",
            "text": "<p>GLP-1s slow gastric emptying, which is great for appetite but often means sluggish digestion, bloating, and constipation that can derail your progress. Each serving delivers 5g of prebiotic fiber from baobab, a gentle whole-fruit fiber that feeds the good gut bacteria and keeps things moving. No harsh laxatives.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/e981915b-1098-451b-bbbe-2707b0d102ac.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "03",
            "eyebrow": "NAUSEA",
            "title": "Nausea and GI Discomfort",
            "text": "<p>Nausea is the #1 reported side effect of GLP-1 medications, especially in the early weeks, and your gut is doing a lot of adjusting. Tiiga's prebiotic fiber and baobab antioxidants support a balanced gut microbiome and normal digestive function while your body settles in.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/UGC_Videos_-_Review_Photos_2_1.webp",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_4": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "04",
            "eyebrow": "ENERGY",
            "title": "Fatigue and Low Energy",
            "text": "<p>Eating less means fewer calories and nutrients, and many GLP-1 users hit an energy wall that makes daily life harder. Baobab is naturally rich in vitamin C, B vitamins, and antioxidants that support sustained energy without stimulants, so you feel like yourself again even in a caloric deficit.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Tiiga.Marketing-HP040.jpg",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "media_fit": "cover",
            "media_ratio": "portrait"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_proof": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "eyebrow": "LOVED BY 1M+",
            "title": "Trusted by 1M+ Customers",
            "text": "<p>Tiiga is the top choice for people looking to fill nutrition gaps in a convenient, tasty way while supporting overall health.</p>",
            "media_style": "checklist",
            "media_position": "right",
            "checklist": "Convenient: pre-portioned sticks, no measuring and no clean-up\nTasty: real fruit flavors with no added sugar\nWhole-body support: prebiotic fiber for your gut, electrolytes for real hydration",
            "background_color": "#1d5a6b",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_1",
        "row_2",
        "row_3",
        "row_4",
        "row_proof"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "GLP-1 medications are life-changing. The side effects? Less so.",
        "text": "<p>Tiiga was designed around the science of what GLP-1 users actually need, starting with your gut.</p>",
        "background_color": "#f6f4f0",
        "padding-block-start": 64,
        "padding-block-end": 64,
        "media_width": "beside"
      }
    },
